  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure C.3: \"Average Subsidy Progression for 10 Agents\". With only ten agents the curves are jagged rather than smooth: red (0.7) oscillates between about 0.03 and 0.083 with no clear decay, green (0.6) between 0.03 and 0.054, cyan (0.8) spikes to 0.061 at agent 2 and decays erratically to near zero by agent 8, magenta (0.9) peaks at 0.024 and fades, blue (0.51) creeps up to about 0.012, and yellow (0.99) is flat at zero. The decay-to-zero structure visible at 100 and 1000 agents is not resolvable at this population size.",
